hadiths[12]{hadithnumber,text}:
"472","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Beshak Allah ne meri ummat se us ko muaf farmaya hai jo un ke dilon mein hota hai, jab tak woh use karen nahin ya kahen nahin.'"
"473","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab ghulam apne Rabb aur apne aaqa ki ita'at kare to us ke liye do ajr hain.' Rawi ne kaha: Jab Abu Rafi' aazad kiye gae to woh rone lage. Un se poocha gaya: Tum kyun ro rahe ho? Unhon ne kaha: Mere paas do ajr the, aur ab un mein se ek ajr chala gaya."
"474","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se kisi ka khadim us ke paas us ka khana lae, aur woh use apne sath na bithae, to use chahiye ke use ek ya do niwale de. Kyunke us ne us ke taiyar karne mein mashaqqat aur garmi bardasht ki hai.'"
"475","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se kisi ka khadim khana lae to use chahiye ke use apne sath bithae aur use niwala de, kyunke us ne pakane ki mashaqqat aur aag ki garmi bhi bardasht ki hai.'"
"476","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo mushtaraka ghulam mein apna hissa aazad kare to us par wajib hai ke agar us ke paas maal ho to woh ghulam ko apne maal se poori tarah aazad kare. Aur agar us ke paas maal na ho to ghulam ki qeemat adl ke sath lagai jae. Phir jo hissa aazad nahin hua us ke bare mein ghulam se kaha jaega ke woh kamae aur khud aazadi hasil kare, lekin us par mashaqqat na dali jae.'"
"477","[AI-translation] Urwah ne is sanad se wohi riwayat bayan ki, aur kaha: Us shareek ke hisse ke bare mein jis ne use aazad nahin kiya: Ghulam se kaha jaega ke woh kamae aur aazadi hasil kare. Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Agar us ke paas maal ho to woh us ke maal se aazad kiya jaega; agar us ke paas maal na ho to ghulam kamaega aur aazadi hasil karega.'"
"478","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai us aadmi ke bare mein jo apna maal muflis ke paas bi-ainihi pae; woh us ka ghair se ziyada haqdar hai. Aur umra jaiz hai. Aur jab ghulam do aadmiyon ka mushtaraka ho, aur un mein se ek apne shareek ke liye apna hissa aazad kare."
"479","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo mushtaraka ghulam mein apna hissa aazad kare, aur agar us ke paas maal ho aur us ke sath koi shareek na ho, to use apne maal se aazad karna us par wajib ho jata hai.'"
"480","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab ghulam is haal mein mare ke woh apne Rabb ki achchi tarah ibadat karta ho aur apne aaqa se bhi mukhlis ho, to Allah use (jahannam se) aazad farmata hai.'"
"481","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Barirah ke shauhar Habshi ghulam the, un ka naam Mughis tha. Goya main unhen Madina ki galiyon mein un (Barirah Raziyallahu anha) ke peeche chakkar lagate dekh raha hun."
"482","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne (apne pyare bete) Ibrahim (Raziyallahu anhu) ki walida (Maria Qibtiyyah Raziyallahu anha) ke bare mein us waqt farmaya jab unhon ne unhen jana tha: 'Un ke bete ne unhen aazad kar diya.'"
"483","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo laundi apne aaqa se bachcha jane, woh us (aaqa) ki maut ke baad aazad ho jaegi.'"
